# Stack & architecture

Stack: Laravel 11, MySQL 8, Filament v3 (admin/teacher/student panels), spatie/laravel-permission, Pest or PHPUnit.

- Use Form Requests, Policies, Services (`app/Services`), and Enums.
- Keep Filament Resources / controllers thin — business logic lives in Services.
- Soft deletes for students, teachers, courses only.
- Never soft-delete or edit posted journal entries — reverse with a new reversing entry.
- Write a feature test for every Service that moves money.

## After each task

List:
1. Files created/changed
2. Commands the user must run (e.g. `php artisan migrate`, `php artisan test`, `composer require …`)
